                <invention-title lang="en">AIRFOIL PLATFORM IMPINGEMENT COOLING HOLES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An airfoil structure (60) for a gas turbine engine includes an airfoil (62) which includes a leading edge (76) and a trailing edge (78). A platform (64) is located adjacent a first end of the airfoil (62) and includes a core passage (90) that extends through the platform (64), a mate-face (84) for engaging an adjacent airfoil structure and a set of impingement cooling holes (88) in communication with the core passage (90) that extend through the mate-face (84) adjacent the trailing edge (78) of the airfoil (62).</p>
            </abstract>
